t page, check out page for WooCommerce'=>'Dit is die URL vir jou betaalpagina, check out page vir Woocommerce','This is the url that you take people who purchased the webinar so they can sign up...'=>'Dit is die URL wat jy neem mense wat die webinar gekoop het, sodat hulle kan registreer ...','This is the url the button goes to (leave blank if you don\'t want the button to appear)...'=>'Dit is die url die knop gaan na (leef blank as jy nie wil dat die knop weerkom nie)...','This is the URL where the order button will go...'=>'Dit is die url waar die bevelknop sal gaan ...','This is the url where your webinar will be viewable... This is only if you want to use your own webinar page with another service...'=>'Dit is die url waar jou webinaar te sien sal wees ... Dit is slegs as jy jou eie webinar bladsy met \'n ander dienste wil gebruik ...','This is the URL you want them to go to when the webinar is over...'=>'Dit is die URL wat jy wil hê hulle gaan na wanneer die webinar is oor ...','This is the URL you want them to go to when they come late...'=>'Dit is die URL wat jy wil dat hulle gaan wanneer hulle laat kom ...','This is the webinar event title, you can use the webinar settings, or use custom event title...'=>'Dit is die Webinar-event titel, jy kan die Webinar-instellings gebruik, of gebruik die aangepaste gebeurtenis-titel ...','This is wether you want to enable the TXT reminder (w/ Twilio)...'=>'Dit is Wether wat jy die TXT herinnering (W / Twilio) wil aktiver.','This is what the CTA button copy says...'=>'Dit is wat die CTA-knop kopie sê ...','This is what the link says for Livestreamingservice dashboard link...'=>'Dit is wat die link sê vir Livestreamingservice dashboard link ...','This is what the link says for WebinarIgnition to your affiliate link... "Webinar Powered By WebinarIgnition" text is necessary to available free registrations upto 100.'=>'Dit is wat die link sê vir Webinarignition na jou affiliate link..."Webinar geleë deur Webinarignition" teks 